    "> - **Train/Test split:** the model is always evaluated on data it has NEVER seen during training. Fitting and evaluating on the same data gives optimistically biased metrics. A held-out test set gives an honest estimate of generalisation performance.\n",
    "> - **Regression:** supervised learning approach for predicting a *continuous* target. Simple Linear Regression (one feature), Multiple Linear Regression (several features), Polynomial Regression (curved relationships). Evaluation uses MAE, MSE, RMSE (error in target units), and R² (fraction of variance explained).\n",
